# Brink Constructors Inc. Website Redesign – Rapid City, SD

We recently partnered with **Brink Constructors Inc.**, a leading electrical construction company based in **Rapid City, South Dakota**, to completely rebuild their website from the ground up. The new site delivers faster performance, cleaner design, and an interactive project experience that better represents their expertise across the region.

---

## Project Overview

- **Client Type:** Electrical Construction Company
- **Location:** Rapid City, South Dakota
- **Services Provided:** Web Design, WordPress Development, Custom Plugin Creation, Drone Photography & Videography
- **Completion Date:** October 2025
- **Primary Benefits Delivered:**
  - ⚡ Streamlined performance with a lightweight, custom WordPress setup
  - ⚡ Interactive project map showcasing ongoing and completed work
  - ⚡ Professional visuals through drone photography and video
  - ⚡ Consistent branding and easy content management

---

## The Challenge

Over time, Brink Constructors’ previous website had become bloated and inconsistent. Multiple designers and developers had worked on it over the years, leaving behind conflicting code, redundant plugins, and poor load times. The site was difficult to update and didn’t reflect the professional quality of Brink Constructors’ operations or the scope of their work across the region.

---

## Our Solution

We started from a **clean WordPress install**, using **Astra** as the foundation for its speed and flexibility. From there, our team built a **custom child theme** to enhance Astra’s base styling with unique design elements and functionality that matched Brink Constructors’ brand.

To highlight their growing list of projects, we developed a **custom project map plugin** that dynamically displays where Brink Constructors is working across the Midwest. The interactive map allows visitors to easily explore current and past projects with location details and imagery.

To complete the redesign, we partnered with professional **drone pilots** to capture stunning aerial footage and photos of Brink Constructors’ offices, field operations, and heavy equipment in action — giving the new site a powerful visual presence.

### Key Tools & Technologies Used

- **WordPress + Astra Theme** – Fast, lightweight, and flexible foundation
- **Custom Child Theme** – Added custom layouts, typography, and styling
- **Custom Map Plugin** – Interactive project visualization
- **Drone Photography & Videography** – Authentic visuals of real operations

---

## Results & Impact

The new website delivers a completely refreshed experience:

- ✅ Lightning-fast performance with simplified backend management
- ✅ Unified branding and design across all pages
- ✅ Interactive map feature for showcasing ongoing projects
- ✅ Visually engaging content with drone footage and imagery

